# flicker noise
--- Netlist
lambda n: np.random.randn() --> n0
lambda n: np.random.randn()*sqrt(1.38) --> n1
lambda n: np.random.randn()*sqrt(1.38) --> n2
lambda n: np.random.randn()*sqrt(1.38) --> n3
lambda n: np.random.randn()*sqrt(1.38) --> n4

n1 --> tf([2*pi*10e6/4.6e9*sqrt(1/10)],[1,-1+2*pi*10e6/4.6e9],1) --> n1_out
n2 --> tf([2*pi*1e6/4.6e9],[1,-1+2*pi*1e6/4.6e9],1) --> n2_out
n3 --> tf([2*pi*1e5/4.6e9*sqrt(10)],[1,-1+2*pi*1e5/4.6e9],1) --> n3_out
n4 --> tf([2*pi*1e4/4.6e9*sqrt(100)],[1,-1+2*pi*1e4/4.6e9],1) --> n4_out
n0, n1_out, n2_out, n3_out, n4_out--> add --> out
